  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Voluntary Contribution to the International Solar Alliance in 2023 and 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK commits to pay a voluntary annual contribution for two years to the International Solar Alliance (ISA), for 2023 and 2024. This will support HMG climate objectives by increasing the deployment of solar energy globally, supporting the world&#x2019;s poorest and most climate vulnerable countries and giving the UK first-mover advantage in terms of support of a key Prime Minister Modi initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
